mutool
Usage: mutool draw -F txt FILE.pdf

The pdf reader (from mupdf). On a text console it turns a pdf into readable text
(or html) so you can grep and page through it. `draw` is the render subcommand;
`-F txt` picks plain-text output.

	mutool draw -F txt file.pdf     pdf -> text (pipe to `less`)
	mutool draw -F html file.pdf    pdf -> html
	mutool draw -F txt file.pdf N   just page N

See also: view, links, mandoc
